{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not turn MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** Any configured plugin now enables this capture path, and an ordinary MDC-adapter exception is passed to `finishInvocation`, producing durable `FAILED` before either plugin hooks or user code run. Treat capture as best-effort or propagate it for an invocation retry instead of permanently terminating valid work.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ki35","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":269,"observation_digest":"3255127afe5c70d4e3fb3ad705acb12faadd9fbf423beeead8dc13b52d468d87","observation_id":"aro_v1_gjkre6x6lrynjy73hllqllfrf6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5yebu2crhve2yvxvednu65a4hs","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"14db8ae956d155999450c9262eec78bf71d38bdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":268,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_xeobsyuwbprcldz6qffxsktiim","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
